---
/**
 * CTA Final LP3 - Gradiente verde
 */
---

<section class="py-24" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #CED994 0%, #005742 100%);">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-serif text-white mb-6">
      Vamos caminhar juntos?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-white/90 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      O primeiro passo para uma nova qualidade de vida começa com o nosso acolhimento.
    </p>
    <a
      href="https://wa.me/554891203870?text=Ol%C3%A1!%20Quero%20fazer%20parte%20da%20Comunidade%20Novos%20Caminhos."
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      onclick="gtag_report_conversion()"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-white text-[#005742] font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-opacity-90 transition-all shadow-lg"
    >
      Falar no WhatsApp
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M7 7h10v10" />
        <path d="M7 17 17 7" />
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
